  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35733980",
      "title": "Which Kind Of Code Goes Into loader()s?",
      "sourceHash": "5206ba891ece457585a8ca9fe3a6239b8be79ad18e895be48a1fbcb626ba808d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 3.66,
          "en": "Okay, we spend quite some time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.66,
          "end": 5.07,
          "en": "on this loader function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.07,
          "end": 7.71,
          "en": "but it is an important concept to understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.71,
          "end": 9.42,
          "en": "Before we now finally take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.42,
          "end": 12.24,
          "en": "at error handling with loaders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.24,
          "end": 15.333,
          "en": "there's one last thing I really want you to keep in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.26,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "This might look like backend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 20.7,
          "en": "It might look like it's decoupled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.7,
          "end": 23.79,
          "en": "from the React application, and it kind of is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.79,
          "end": 27.3,
          "en": "But as mentioned before, this code that's defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.3,
          "end": 32.13,
          "en": "in the loader, executes in the browser, not on some server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 34.35,
          "en": "And I'm highlighting this because that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.35,
          "end": 37.38,
          "en": "means that you can use any browser APIs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.38,
          "end": 39.39,
          "en": "in your loader functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.39,
          "end": 42.09,
          "en": "You can, for example, access local storage here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.09,
          "end": 44.01,
          "en": "You can access cookies here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 45.9,
          "en": "You can do anything you can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.9,
          "end": 48.183,
          "en": "in the other JavaScript code as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.26,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "What you can't do in your loader function is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "for example, use React Hooks like useState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 58.23,
          "en": "That does not work because those Hooks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "are only available in React components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "and the loader function is not a React component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 67.02,
          "en": "But that's the only limitation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.02,
          "end": 69.57,
          "en": "Any other default browser features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.57,
          "end": 72.123,
          "en": "can be used in loader functions.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}